              {
                "content": "The 10% rule states that only about 10% of the energy from one trophic level is transferred to the next. To calculate 10% of a quantity, you can multiply that quantity by 0.10 (or $\\frac{1}{10}$). You'll need to apply this rule for each transfer.",
